abstract: >-
  Report list (URLs and hashes), page structure, photo placements, photo-to-text links, six annotation tasks
  with guidelines, every result file and the code and frozen configuration behind the paper
  "Do Sustainability Report Photos Show What the Text Claims? A Dataset and a Four-Level Measurement":
  443 Chinese-language sustainability reports from 150 listed Taiwanese firms (reporting years 2023-2025),
  17,450 photos, and a four-level measurement of photographic evidence (evidence, illustration, packaging,
  unrelated). The report PDFs and the images cut from them are not redistributed; the release rebuilds them
  from the public filings.
